    "sections": {
        "description": "Titan Elearning Theme is a powerful, cutting-edge solution for online education, e-learning platforms, academic websites, and virtual classrooms, making it ideal for school websites, university portals, college sites, distance learning, and professional training centers. Designed for seamless LMS integration, it supports online courses, interactive student dashboards, live classes, and advanced learning management features, making it perfect for online tutoring, academic coaching, private classes, homeschooling, K-12 learning, higher education, vocational training, and technical programs. It’s an excellent fit for coding classes, programming tutorials, science education, STEM learning, creative writing, humanities, history, and social studies courses. This theme offers a modern, clean, mobile-friendly, and retina-ready design with adaptive learning tools, dynamic sliders, customizable banners, and gamification features to enhance engagement. It also supports blended learning, AI-powered education modules, open educational resources, and digital textbooks while offering seamless integration with the LearnPress plugin for course creation, quizzes, lesson scheduling, and student progress tracking. Perfect for educational institutions, e-learning startups, and training centers, this theme combines powerful personalization options with optimized performance to create a dynamic, accessible, and future-ready online learning experience. Demo: https://preview.titanthemes.net/titan-elearning/"
    },
